      <Output>
        <StdOut>Given a heat-equation source case from "heat_equation/sample/gaussian.json"
-&gt; done: HeatEquationAmplitudeSteps.GivenAHeatEquationSourceCase("heat_equation/sam...") (0.0s)
And a heat-equation transformation "ScaleAmplitude" with parameter "factor" set to "2"
-&gt; done: HeatEquationAmplitudeSteps.GivenTheHeatEquationTransformation("ScaleAmplitude", "factor", "2") (0.0s)
When I run source and the generated follow-up through the heat-equation solver
-&gt; done: HeatEquationAmplitudeSteps.WhenIRunThroughTheHeatEquationSolver() (0.4s)
Then the heat-equation parsed value "max_u" of the generated follow-up should be greater than the source
-&gt; done: HeatEquationAmplitudeSteps.ThenParsedValueShouldBeGreater("max_u") (0.0s)
And the heat-equation follow-up max_u should be at least 1.95 times the source max_u
-&gt; done: HeatEquationAmplitudeSteps.ThenFollowUpMaxRatioFloor(1.95) (0.0s)
And the heat-equation follow-up max_u should be at most 2.05 times the source max_u
-&gt; done: HeatEquationAmplitudeSteps.ThenFollowUpMaxRatioCeiling(2.05) (0.0s)</StdOut>
